WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.591
Jeromy’s decision method begins with business
context.

00:00:03.591 --> 00:00:08.645
Write down the decision, the stakeholders, the
workload and the constraints.

00:00:08.645 --> 00:00:15.229
In our new example, a campus service must search,
export records, recover from failures and add new

00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:15.761
sources.

00:00:15.761 --> 00:00:21.945
A tailored service and a shared platform are
alternatives, but neither is best without agreed

00:00:21.945 --> 00:00:22.544
criteria.

00:00:22.544 --> 00:00:26.002
Define what success means before looking at a score.

00:00:26.002 --> 00:00:28.688
Replace broad qualities with scenarios.

00:00:28.688 --> 00:00:32.821
State the context, the stimulus and the observable
response.

00:00:32.821 --> 00:00:39.640
Search at a specified load, recovery after a worker
failure, and adding a data source are different

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.328
scenarios.

00:00:40.328 --> 00:00:42.257
Each needs its own evidence.

00:00:42.257 --> 00:00:48.387
Our campus example uses explicit targets, but those
targets are assumptions for practice.

00:00:48.387 --> 00:00:53.553
In real work, negotiate them with stakeholders and
define repeatable tests.

00:00:53.602 --> 00:00:56.241
Organize the scenarios in a quality tree.

00:00:56.241 --> 00:01:02.614
In our example, Performance contains Search and
Export, while Availability and Maintainability each

00:01:02.614 --> 00:01:03.773
have one scenario.

00:01:03.773 --> 00:01:05.511
Rank siblings at each node.

00:01:05.511 --> 00:01:10.596
The number of leaves does not automatically
determine a quality’s total weight.

00:01:10.596 --> 00:01:15.682
Check the tree for missing concerns and duplicates
before calculating anything.

00:01:15.702 --> 00:01:18.093
ROC translates a ranking into weights.

00:01:18.093 --> 00:01:23.568
For three siblings, the weights are eleven
eighteenths, five eighteenths and one ninth.

00:01:23.568 --> 00:01:27.155
For two siblings they are three quarters and one
quarter.

00:01:27.155 --> 00:01:30.365
These numbers sum to one within each sibling group.

00:01:30.365 --> 00:01:35.463
Use the formula at each node and keep full precision
until displaying the result.

00:01:35.463 --> 00:01:38.106
The rankings still express human judgment.

00:01:38.106 --> 00:01:41.870
A scenario’s combined weight is the product along
its path.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:48.185
Search receives eleven eighteenths times three
quarters, or about zero point four five eight three.

00:01:48.185 --> 00:01:51.502
Export receives about zero point one five two eight.

00:01:51.502 --> 00:01:57.180
The other leaves receive zero point two seven seven
eight and zero point one one one one.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.540
The complete leaf weights sum to one.
